p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Stay independent. Stay comfortable. We handle the rest.</span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-mnlwu8tb":{"html":"<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The Essentials:</span></span></p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif; font-weight:normal; font-size:16px;\">\n<li style=\"line-height:1.6em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Grocery Shopping and Pickup</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:1.6em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Appointment Transportation</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:1.6em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Meal Prep</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:1.6em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">House Cleaning</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:1.6em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Laundry</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:1.6em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Senior Support and Companionship</span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">And More:</span></span></p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif; font-weight:normal; font-size:16px;\">\n<li style=\"line-height:1.6em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Tech support and device help</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:1.6em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Prescription Pickup</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:1.6em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Waiting services (repairmen, deliveries)</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:1.6em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">DMV, post office, and government office runs</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:1.6em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Coordinating specialty services</span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"pageBackground_syg00":{"fillLayers":{"containerId":"pageBackground_syg00","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false},"isMediaPositionOverride":false,"mediaHeightOverrideType":""},"syg00":{"className":"theme-vars"},"comp-mnlq7p1d1":{"meshProps":{"wedges":["comp-mnlq7p1d1inlineContent-wedge-9"],"rotatedComponents":[],"fixedComponents":[]},"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-mnlq7p1d1","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shoul